              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo bigambo ebirukubazaaho Mowabbu. Ebibuga Aari na Kiiri zihwerekerezibwa omu kiro kimu, orubuga Mowabbu rugwirwemu akahuno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Dibboni batembere omu biikaro ebya haiguru nuho balirirra. Mowabbu neeririrra Neebo na Medeba, abantu boona beemwire isoke boona bakonere emireju; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu makuute nuho barukujwarra, ha maju eruguru n'omu mazigati nuho baterra empamo, nuho balirirra muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Hesibooni n'aba Eryeri nibaborooga, iraka lyabo nirihulirwa aba Yahazi; nikyo abantu aba Mowabbu bajwaliire eby'okurwanisa nikyo barukukungira, nikyo barukutukumirra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninsaalirirwa muno Mowabbu; abasingwa baayo nibairukira Zohara na Egilaasi-serisiya. Habwokuba, ha matemba ga Luhiisi, nuho barukugenda nibarra; obu barukuhika ha rugendo orurukugenda Horonaimu, batokere, tihakamezire bunyansi bundi tihakiroho kintu ekibisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaizi ga Nimirimu kifurukwa; obunyansi buhotokere, obunyasi obuto tibukyamera, tihaakya kintu kibisi na kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endurundu y'ebintu ebi beetungire n'ebi baayahwire nikyo barukubitwarra, nibabirabya ha kisaaru eky'emikinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, ensi eya Mowabbu yoona ehuliire empamo; eboroogo ehikire Egulaimu na Beerelimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaizi ga Dibboni noobu garaaba gaijwire esagama, nkyaina n'ekindi ekindaaleetera abantu baayo; nizo entale eziraataagura aba Mowabbu abaatabukire n'abandi abaasigaire omunsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
